---

## Appendix: Methodology Notes

- **Search period:** 2023 to present (June 2026) with emphasis on 2025-2026
- **Search tools used:** Exa neural search, Firecrawl web search, Google AI Search
- **Content extraction:** Full-page markdown extraction from 10+ primary source URLs
- **Source types:** Industry news (ERR, Biometric Update), provider press releases (SK ID Solutions), regulatory analysis (Dutch Payments Association, Stibbe, Deloitte, Fourthline), industry association reports (Mobey Forum, FIDO Alliance), EU Large Scale Pilot findings (POTENTIAL, NOBID), commercial analysis (Signicat), price lists and technical documentation (SK ID Solutions GitHub)
- **Limitations:** Primary evidence concentrated on Estonian/Baltic market as Smart-ID+ lead deployment region. Cross-referenced with pan-European regulatory analysis to ensure generalisability. Limited public disclosure by individual banks on internal strategic decision-making.
